WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.576
Pick a layout from the palette, like Part-part-whole.

2
00:00:06.576 --> 00:00:10.082
Today’s task: a class has 24 pets, and 15 are dogs.

3
00:00:10.082 --> 00:00:13.732
Type in a part to give it a name.

4
00:00:13.732 --> 00:00:17.148
Tap a part’s number and type its size.

5
00:00:17.148 --> 00:00:19.903
− and + still change a part by one.

6
00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:23.856
15 dogs and 9 cats make 24 pets.

7
00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:26.119
Add a part from the palette.

8
00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:31.614
Tap a part to select it, then press Delete.

9
00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:39.054
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
